26429-    'v5.4.2-16. BEFORE INSERT OR UPDATE OR DELETE on places, every role. INSERT: the code is of its kind''s form (a state''s is its state_code); a parent exactly when the kind takes one, of an allowed kind, the same state, in force over the whole range; stamps. Never deleted. UPDATE: only a close (effective_to once, stamped with the session role), only by a role that sees every tenant (superuser or BYPASSRLS), only under READ COMMITTED, after the exclusive place lock, and not while a membership, profile (owned by it, or for a state governed by it), fact or child place citing it runs past the close, nor while a utility jurisdiction points at it.';
